cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "VisionGuard: Real-Time AI System for Detecting Safety Hazards in Video Streams"
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zorykto
    alias: zoryktom
    website: "https://github.com/zoryktom"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zoryktom/VisionGuard"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-14"
abstract: >
  VisionGuard is a production-style computer vision stack for real-time
  workplace hazard detection. It combines a pluggable detector backend
  (YOLOv8 / VGNet / dummy), a Kalman IoU tracker, and temporal hazard
  fusion with zone-aware risk scoring.
